<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Kriti ❤️</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;500;700&family=Great+Vibes&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;
overflow-x:hidden;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#240014,#5b001d,#9b0037,#ff4f8b);
color:white;
}

section{
min-height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
flex-direction:column;
padding:30px;
text-align:center;
position:relative;
overflow:hidden;
}

h1{
font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;
font-size:70px;
text-shadow:0 0 20px gold;
animation:glow 2s infinite alternate;
}

h2{
font-size:40px;
margin-top:15px;
}

p{
max-width:800px;
font-size:20px;
line-height:1.8;
margin-top:20px;
}

@keyframes glow{
from{
text-shadow:0 0 15px pink;
}
to{
text-shadow:0 0 40px gold;
}
}

button{
padding:16px 45px;
font-size:20px;
border:none;
border-radius:50px;
cursor:pointer;
margin-top:35px;
background:linear-gradient(45deg,#ff006e,#ffbe0b);
color:white;
box-shadow:0 0 20px gold;
transition:.4s;
}

button:hover{
transform:scale(1.08);
}

.card{
background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
padding:35px;
border-radius:30px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
box-shadow:0 0 35px rgba(255,255,255,.2);
max-width:900px;
}

.heart{
position:absolute;
color:#ff80ab;
animation:float 8s linear infinite;
opacity:.8;
}

@keyframes float{

0%{
transform:translateY(100vh);
opacity:0;
}

20%{
opacity:1;
}

100%{
transform:translateY(-120px);
opacity:0;
}

}

.balloon{
position:absolute;
width:70px;
height:90px;
border-radius:50%;
animation:up 14s linear infinite;
}

.balloon:after{
content:"";
position:absolute;
width:2px;
height:70px;
background:white;
left:34px;
top:90px;
}

@keyframes up{

0%{
transform:translateY(110vh);
}

100%{
transform:translateY(-150px);
}

}

#countdown{
font-size:35px;
margin-top:20px;
color:#ffe082;
font-weight:bold;
}

.gallery{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
gap:25px;
width:100%;
margin-top:40px;
}

.upload-box{

border:3px dashed white;
padding:40px;
border-radius:20px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);

}

.upload-box input{
margin-top:20px;
}

.cake{
font-size:170px;
cursor:pointer;
transition:.5s;
}

.cake:hover{
transform:scale(1.1);
}

#loveLetter{
display:none;
font-size:23px;
margin-top:25px;
line-height:2;
animation:fade 2s;
}

@keyframes fade{

from{
opacity:0;
transform:translateY(30px);
}

to{
opacity:1;
transform:translateY(0);
}

}

#giftMessage{
display:none;
font-size:30px;
margin-top:30px;
color:#ffd54f;
animation:fade 2s;
}

footer{
padding:40px;
text-align:center;
font-size:18px;
background:#2b0010;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<section>

<div class="card">

<h1>Happy Birthday</h1>

<h2>Kriti ❤️</h2>

<p>

To the most beautiful girl in my life...

Today the world celebrates your birthday,

but my heart celebrates the day my happiness was born.

You are my smile, my peace, my favourite person and my forever.

Happy Birthday, My Princess.

❤️

</p>

<div id="countdown"></div>

<button onclick="document.getElementById('love').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">

Begin Our Love Journey ❤️

</button>

</div>

</section>

<section id="love">

<div class="card">

<h1>💌</h1>

<h2>A Letter From Aayush</h2>

<p>

Every heartbeat reminds me of you.

Every smile carries your name.

No matter where life takes us,

I promise to stand beside you forever.

Happy Birthday My Love.

</p>

<button onclick="showLetter()">

Open Secret Letter

</button>

<div id="loveLetter">

❤️ My Dearest Kriti ❤️

You are the best thing that has ever happened to me.

Thank you for making my world brighter.

May all your dreams come true.

I wish I could celebrate every birthday with you forever.

I Love You More Than Words Can Explain.

Forever Yours,

❤️ Aayush ❤️

</div>

</div>

</section>
